{"step_index":319,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-25T18:43:20Z","thinking":"Initial design considerations for the `index.html` portal are underway for SLONE GLOBAL CORP. The aesthetic will be avant-garde, ultra-clean, brutalist with a dark theme accented by bold, imposing typography and fluorescent yellow flashes (`#E3FF00`). Ensuring full responsiveness across mobile and desktop is paramount. The primary sections identified are a Header/Navbar incorporating the logo (golden/fluorescent crown), a ticker displaying either a fictional stock quote or a drop unit counter, and navigational links.\n\n\nThe site structure is taking shape, incorporating key sections: OS ecosystem, Atelier/Merch, hardware, integrated TV remote, and a dynamic shopping cart.  The hero section will feature bold typography, an image of the flagship store, and call-to-action buttons. Subsequent divisions will highlight the OS's technical advantages and the product catalog for Drop 01. The live TV remote demo and a luxury checkout modal are also planned.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Portal Web Oficial Interactivo de SLONE ENTERPRISES: Ecosistema Multimedia, Catálogo de Merchandising Drop 01, Mando Remoto Integrado y Arquitectura Global de Marca.","UserFacing":false},"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"es\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>SLONE™ — Sovereign Media, Hardware & Atelier</title>\n  <link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" href=\"/assets/crown_icon.png\">\n  <style>\n    :root {\n      --bg: #000000;\n      --surface: #0a0a0c;\n      --card: #111114;\n      --border: #1e1e24;\n      --border-focus: #e3ff00;\n      --fluor: #e3ff00;\n      --fluor-glow: rgba(227, 255, 0, 0.35);\n      --text: #ffffff;\n      --muted: #8b8b93;\n      --green: #00e676;\n    }\n\n    *